a:2:{s:7:"content";s:1118:"<p>Asghar Khan Utmankhel, Chairman of APMIA, along with Wisal Khan, President of Mardan Industries Association (MIA) &amp; former CEC member APMIA, held a meeting with Engr. Said Mehmood, Vice Chairman of KPBOIT, and his team regarding the proposal of “KP Dimension Stone (Marble &amp; Granite) Expo and Investment Conference” and other different sector development initiatives. It was proposed to establish this event as a regular annual occurrence to enhance the dimension stone sector in KP.</p>
<p>Furthermore, collaborative efforts will be made to engage other government and private organizations, facilitating direct exports from KP.<br />
In conclusion, Vice Chairman KPBOIT presented an appreciation shield to Asghar Khan, Chairman of APMIA, in recognition of his dedicated efforts to advance the dimension stone sector in Pakistan.</p>
<p>In a second meeting held at KPTEVTA with Tahir Khan, the provincial coordinator of GIZ TEVT Support Program, the agenda revolved around forming a technical committee for reviewing, implementing Marble technician curricula, and other sector development projects.</p>";s:12:"content_meta";N;}